# SPA fallback for the web build (Cloudflare Pages / Netlify syntax).
#
# `expo export --platform web` emits a SINGLE index.html — Expo Router resolves
# every route client-side. Without this catch-all the host looks for a real file
# at each path, so a refresh or a direct link to /settings, /report, /privacy or
# /sighting/<id> returns 404. The 200 status rewrites (not redirects), so the
# URL the user sees is preserved.
#
# Anything in public/ is copied verbatim to the root of dist/ on every build,
# which is why this lives here rather than being written into dist/ after the
# fact (expo export clears the output directory each run).
/*    /index.html   200
